WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:01.400
Your son is dull

00:01.480 --> 00:03.160
Has not yet understood Father's intent

00:03.240 --> 00:05.573
Nor dare presume to guess Father's meaning

00:05.720 --> 00:09.640
That Yu Gong from the Imperial Academy who wrote the seditious poem

00:09.720 --> 00:11.387
Do you know this man?

00:12.200 --> 00:13.600
Rise and answer

00:14.320 --> 00:15.560
Thank you, Father

